      "role": "user",
      "content": "we tried raising the temp a bit and it helped slightly but the patches are still there. it's weird because the pressure is consistent across the whole plate too. could it be something with the ink itself or maybe the way the heat is being distributed? it feels like the color just... vanishes in certain spots even though the machine seems fine.",
